{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Do not wait indefinitely after suspension or retry is selected.** The handler must finish before the selected outcome is processed, so a blocked `finally` or end hook can turn valid `PENDING`/`RETRYING` into a Lambda timeout. Bound cleanup using the remaining invocation time and force a retry before the deadline; add a non-returning-finally regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77Ma8X","finding_digest":"d34970da8c622b783e59c3d63971052058c1ab1e1e5ea29410929a444e633510","finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::suspension-liveness","line":126,"observation_digest":"158128dc3cd9b0628f73e493b40e5c70a35912c3abbdad1be762180b44836e01","observation_id":"aro_v1_cwasrxb43gygfd3t4sj3ids4oc","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2nexbwummivxqpszyplds4ifeb","published_at":"2026-10-08T03:40:30Z","review_id":"arr_v1_jyrf7mvlhnckcfrfbuwa7kwgjo","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"1735ff8302326dc678019e4d55498f001e003841","reviewer":"codex","start_line":126,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_mlyhes2ouch2xxafwfrsuwytyk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T03:40:30Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
